  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "早頓ê引誘魅力"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>張寶明</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">早起m̄是亂鐘仔，顛倒是去hōo大tsūn雨拍鐵厝厝頂phi̍h-phia̍k叫ê聲吵精神，天色猶原bông-bông phú-phú。想著今仔日是禮拜，落雨又koh涼冷ê天，nuà床上kài好。目睭kheh，bē落眠，suah nuà來nuà去。E̋！興食ê giàn夯--起-來--ah--neh！行，來去！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit tsūn雨是入春以來上大tsūn--ê，雨大滴koh雄，塗跤水流窟積，布鞋醬糊糊；áu三áu式ê雨傘siunn細支，雨滴遮bē完全，褲跤tâm-lì-lok。Tâm bē hua我tng興ê giàn。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">沿路十外分鐘lóng leh閃積水窟，liam-mi大hua̍h，liam-mi小步；m̄是歪倒爿踏--去，就是斜正爿hua̍h--去，跤ná leh踏跤花無閒tshih-tshah，雖bóng跤底無爽快，興頭原在。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">來到林--家花園正手爿後面ê市仔，一擔麵擔仔ê擔仔台白煙tshìng kah白茫茫，踮擔仔ê前台坐--落-來，注文大碗--ê、ta--ê、細條ê外省仔麵kah一碗肉羹。恬恬仔欣賞頭家bāu麵、phû肉羹ê手路：一丸生麵tàn落去麵tshi̍k仔，麵箸一直lā；kō麵糊ê生肉羹liàm一條一條hē落去sa̍h鍋--裡phû；一手phâng碗、一手khe̍h舊舊舊ê湯匙仔khat tsô料kah油蔥，熟手kah ná天生--ê。Tsit个時tsūn，鼻著phû肉羹kah油蔥tshìng--出-來ê芳氣，喙瀾是吞bē離，擔仔ê燒氣mā hōo我規身軀燒lō--起-來，khi-móo-tsih就án-ne tuè leh giang--起-來。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">兩三下手，麵kah肉羹phâng來到面頭前，古早味ê ta麵是熟sāi kah，清湯肉羹是興kah。就我所知，tsit款煮法ê肉羹全台灣是kan-na林--家花園tsit箍圍仔有niā-niā。Phû好ê肉羹khat來囥tsô料ê碗--裡，一粒卵拍散淋落去phû肉羹ê湯--裡，隨浮卵花，khat仔連卵花掛清湯liô來碗--裡，摻芫荽，sám胡椒，一碗芳kòng-kòng koh suí色ê清湯肉羹就hōo我來享受thang滿足興味。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit-lō特別ê早頓，thìng好siânn我透風落雨koh tio̍h拍破生活ê sù-sī圈，it著滿足喙空ê giàn，thang調和ak-tsak ê心情，tsit款引誘魅力ê力頭hōo人無才調磅。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><!--more--><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEghfEND6N9OIzxpxicsvqy6j3h4o-anyBcQa71svh-88ovXw2veiROgjddke4nA0ISOCRyXag_LmyT7ekqkhUH_bJplE1itbp_t0gECrUKLQvO4zF8Fs2Hkhes-1WLtblGlQsK6ZUetsN-fuHVxEfnhY1Hz57w6ZGQOnLqDmHHk7IAjByBkuAcZnEZeQhOT/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362%E6%9C%9F_38.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEghfEND6N9OIzxpxicsvqy6j3h4o-anyBcQa71svh-88ovXw2veiROgjddke4nA0ISOCRyXag_LmyT7ekqkhUH_bJplE1itbp_t0gECrUKLQvO4zF8Fs2Hkhes-1WLtblGlQsK6ZUetsN-fuHVxEfnhY1Hz57w6ZGQOnLqDmHHk7IAjByBkuAcZnEZeQhOT/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362%E6%9C%9F_38.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><p><span></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgr5b7g89EJzWaZej0x81gbwHN1k5wpIdOIpOF1PqE7wmKgZnJBE3lK4MifxxtNeLI3nwZK6phuK7k_YUgpfhan02noOhsnyDVnbf2D8FePOLPfSFMwXyfnx8jVOZ33e6z40aEJZnWj78K46Ja0XkCr8lzCObzRJto3hcOzPj6s_nwVo6m-mX9SRbrHAfs1/s1424/362%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgr5b7g89EJzWaZej0x81gbwHN1k5wpIdOIpOF1PqE7wmKgZnJBE3lK4MifxxtNeLI3nwZK6phuK7k_YUgpfhan02noOhsnyDVnbf2D8FePOLPfSFMwXyfnx8jVOZ33e6z40aEJZnWj78K46Ja0